<title>USA: Rodman &amp; Renshaw CEO Charles Daggs Resigns.</title>
<headline>Rodman &amp; Renshaw CEO Charles Daggs Resigns.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rodman &amp; Renshaw Capital Group Inc said Tuesday that Charles Daggs resigned as chief executive.</p>
<p>The company did not explain the reason for the resignation. Company officials were not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>The company named Joseph Shanahan as president and chief executive officer. Shanahan, 49, has been the company's chief operating officer for the past 11 months.</p>
<p>Edwin McGuinn, a vice president, also left the company, Rodman &amp; Renshaw added.</p>
</text>
